    "format_id": "65cef4bc-323d-468b-8b1a-e03cb95f340f",
    "duration": 2.168
  },
  {
    "id": "6818bc32-f5b2-4255-9908-84328a080f6c",
    "item_id": "26b9fabc-dad7-428b-bbc3-4d40c9e01d42",
    "text": "Ja, maar bij aflevering 2 is het meteen al anders. Dus dit was echt \u00e9\u00e9n, nummer \u00e9\u00e9n, dat we echt wel echt onwennig met elkaar daar zaten.",
    "start_time": 2730.362,
    "end_time": 2735.725,
    "audio_url": "https://voxpop.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/audio/trimmed/trimmed_9ee7131e-606f-427b-8242-4495c4681c82.mp3",
    "tier": "holdout",
    "format_id": "628b7fb7-87fd-40c2-91bb-6e1d2efd7a0c",
    "duration": 5.363
  },
  {
    "id": "fa68ae9e-6076-4fbf-88cb-5872d8da2669",
    "item_id": "bd6221f2-3d60-470e-a794-b9e57e094c34",
    "text": "Nee, je kunt door Drenthe heen.",
    "start_time": 1550.821,
    "end_time": 1553.963,
    "audio_url": "https://voxpop.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/audio/trimmed/trimmed_e49a0e9b-d459-4aec-bbe8-3965d2923103.mp3",
    "tier": "holdout",
    "format_id": "628b7fb7-87fd-40c2-91bb-6e1d2efd7a0c",
    "duration": 3.142
  },
  {
    "id": "6ec2d649-4622-4015-b7e4-27e5a7f36bde",
    "item_id": "58fa9d67-f2bc-4e8b-8773-9a3dc3f3dc17",
    "text": "Vroeger waren alle baantjes voor ons. Dat is niet meer zo, omdat die.",
    "start_time": 907.375,
    "end_time": 910.377,
    "audio_url": "https://voxpop.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/audio/formats/a2017446-5a32-4b48-8ee8-2a8574654c04/WO_AT_20238742.mp3",
    "tier": "holdout",
    "format_id": "a2017446-5a32-4b48-8ee8-2a8574654c04",
    "duration": 3.002
  },
  {
    "id": "0c307b92-ec23-4330-a35a-83d5b1297367",
    "item_id": "c46f83c9-c551-4abb-9447-c7b2f6412e1b",
    "text": "Kouma, ja. Het is voor jou vet, maar het is voor de bezoekers van de sauna minder vet, afhankelijk van. Je staat wel fijn.",
    "start_time": 210.785,
    "end_time": 218.448,
    "audio_url": "https://voxpop.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/audio/formats/dcacd05c-ff24-4403-84b1-c89857052dcb/7b8df080-8949-4caf-962a-6f048ecbf1d1.mp3",
    "tier": "holdout",
    "format_id": "dcacd05c-ff24-4403-84b1-c89857052dcb",
    "duration": 7.663
  },
  {
    "id": "9c874e00-87ed-40af-940b-90311c0a2e40",
    "item_id": "23ff4e91-fb5e-44c2-aed2-b2825906bb62",
    "text": "Precies, ja. Dus wat deze vrouw heeft gedaan, is allereerst haar eigen kinderen, wat al grappig is, gewoon een telefoon een maand lang afgenomen.",
    "start_time": 218.795,
    "end_time": 228.78,
    "audio_url": "https://voxpop.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/audio/formats/dcacd05c-ff24-4403-84b1-c89857052dcb/2b1633de-0771-456d-8d87-ef060da51491.mp3",
    "tier": "holdout",
    "format_id": "dcacd05c-ff24-4403-84b1-c89857052dcb",
    "duration": 9.985
  },
  {
    "id": "3a867e93-d908-4e40-ba46-a6b2c783ff8d",
    "item_id": "a9907317-ff44-4276-8fe1-d70a1a993e47",
    "text": "Een mens kan maar zoveel doen in het leven. Dit lijkt me gewoon heel leuk om een keer met Jan Dirk op het podium te staan.",
    "start_time": 625.434,
    "end_time": 629.176,
    "audio_url": "https://voxpop.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/audio/formats/dcacd05c-ff24-4403-84b1-c89857052dcb/4ff8481c-856c-4be2-ad8d-2e2f2496abeb.mp3",
    "tier": "holdout",
    "format_id": "dcacd05c-ff24-4403-84b1-c89857052dcb",
    "duration": 3.742
  },
  {
    "id": "5123cac3-fb00-48f7-bb52-21b34eec7da7",
    "item_id": "26b9fabc-dad7-428b-bbc3-4d40c9e01d42",
    "text": "Ergens op een vliesje hing het nog. En dat wilde je kwijt.",
    "start_time": 489.653,
    "end_time": 494.414,
    "audio_url": "https://voxpop.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/audio/trimmed/trimmed_9ee7131e-606f-427b-8242-4495c4681c82.mp3",
    "tier": "holdout",
    "format_id": "628b7fb7-87fd-40c2-91bb-6e1d2efd7a0c",
    "duration": 4.761
  },
  {
    "id": "83964e79-79ca-49c8-9a47-436a703bc4c4",
    "item_id": "a9907317-ff44-4276-8fe1-d70a1a993e47",
    "text": "Ik weet niet of deze call to action heel goed heeft gewerkt, maar ja, merken wel weer. Dag!",
    "start_time": 2804.76,
    "end_time": 2808.784,
    "audio_url": "https://voxpop.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/audio/formats/dcacd05c-ff24-4403-84b1-c89857052dcb/4ff8481c-856c-4be2-ad8d-2e2f2496abeb.mp3",
    "tier": "holdout",
    "format_id": "dcacd05c-ff24-4403-84b1-c89857052dcb",
    "duration": 4.024
  },
  {
    "id": "075cc80c-3749-47a4-9f15-5084655dc862",
    "item_id": "e35e9f03-30bf-42aa-9fee-58786be42910",
    "text": "Nou, dat is een heel smerig verhaal. Ik weet helemaal niet of jullie het willen horen.",
    "start_time": 1193.205,
    "end_time": 1197.287,
    "audio_url": "https://voxpop.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/audio/trimmed/trimmed_a16653f1-a388-4155-b4d2-9d06f06974ca.mp3",
    "tier": "holdout",
    "format_id": "628b7fb7-87fd-40c2-91bb-6e1d2efd7a0c",
    "duration": 4.082
  },
  {
    "id": "8839e30e-bc9a-4416-965a-52a7081a0c4a",
    "item_id": "ea03f277-de50-45be-b56f-37b6eb1f5a61",
    "text": "And it gets even crazier.",
    "start_time": 48.461,
    "end_time": 50.549,
    "audio_url": "https://voxpop.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/audio/youtube/65cef4bc-323d-468b-8b1a-e03cb95f340f/q71d1Fed_os.mp3",
    "tier": "holdout",
    "format_id": "65cef4bc-323d-468b-8b1a-e03cb95f340f",
    "duration": 2.088
  },
  {
    "id": "540bf504-f558-4259-937a-9dc4e2e10f47",
    "item_id": "e0e7ad9f-7f46-45a3-b232-5aeb13028dfa",
    "text": "Daar kun je geen gebeen mee maken toch met gootsteenontstopper?",
    "start_time": 922.876,
    "end_time": 925.798,
    "audio_url": "https://voxpop.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/audio/formats/628b7fb7-87fd-40c2-91bb-6e1d2efd7a0c/gid://art19-episode-locator/V0/vur_BTD-Ad9Hapt0UUIPceJzWK0Bij2y9uwtCVZeryg.mp3",
    "tier": "holdout",
    "format_id": "628b7fb7-87fd-40c2-91bb-6e1d2efd7a0c",
    "duration": 2.922
  },
  {
    "id": "000d24ee-d2d0-43f3-84d2-17457a458b7f",
    "item_id": "5f4d2f01-c367-41da-a159-2fa9724bae0a",
    "text": "Nou ja, dat weet ik niet. Want ik denk eigenlijk dat iemand als Trump die die nodig natuurlijk niet echt uit dat je dat je daarmee in gesprek gaat of zo. Ik bedoel, wat moet je daar verder mee?",
    "start_time": 2387.964,
    "end_time": 2396.871,
    "audio_url": "https://voxpop.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/audio/formats/a2017446-5a32-4b48-8ee8-2a8574654c04/WO_AT_20239559.mp3",
    "tier": "holdout",
    "format_id": "a2017446-5a32-4b48-8ee8-2a8574654c04",
    "duration": 8.907
  },
  {
    "id": "3b2727c6-ebf7-4a72-9101-7064c90feac3",
    "item_id": "e0e7ad9f-7f46-45a3-b232-5aeb13028dfa",
    "text": "Alles zonder controle. Sorry, maandag vertrek je. Hoe laat?",
    "start_time": 3045.896,
    "end_time": 3048.837,
    "audio_url": "https://voxpop.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/audio/formats/628b7fb7-87fd-40c2-91bb-6e1d2efd7a0c/gid://art19-episode-locator/V0/vur_BTD-Ad9Hapt0UUIPceJzWK0Bij2y9uwtCVZeryg.mp3",
    "tier": "holdout",
    "format_id": "628b7fb7-87fd-40c2-91bb-6e1d2efd7a0c",
    "duration": 2.941
  },
  {
    "id": "e2961bf2-a550-4bec-91ee-b65836a472a9",
    "item_id": "e0e7ad9f-7f46-45a3-b232-5aeb13028dfa",
    "text": "En dan is kleine Domien, eh... En dan gaat daar het bloed heen.",
    "start_time": 733.256,
    "end_time": 736.499,
    "audio_url": "https://voxpop.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/audio/formats/628b7fb7-87fd-40c2-91bb-6e1d2efd7a0c/gid://art19-episode-locator/V0/vur_BTD-Ad9Hapt0UUIPceJzWK0Bij2y9uwtCVZeryg.mp3",
    "tier": "holdout",
    "format_id": "628b7fb7-87fd-40c2-91bb-6e1d2efd7a0c",
    "duration": 3.243
  },
  {
    "id": "40be9123-eb8f-435d-9a6e-2f836ce0f2a0",
    "item_id": "e0e7ad9f-7f46-45a3-b232-5aeb13028dfa",
    "text": "Nee, je zegt het ook een beetje overdreven. Een beetje naar accent doe jij dan. Ja, precies. Zo zeg jij het.",
    "start_time": 2761.338,
    "end_time": 2767.182,
    "audio_url": "https://voxpop.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/audio/formats/628b7fb7-87fd-40c2-91bb-6e1d2efd7a0c/gid://art19-episode-locator/V0/vur_BTD-Ad9Hapt0UUIPceJzWK0Bij2y9uwtCVZeryg.mp3",
    "tier": "holdout",
    "format_id": "628b7fb7-87fd-40c2-91bb-6e1d2efd7a0c",
    "duration": 5.844
  },
  {
    "id": "b47201de-1e73-468f-a349-8f8a03b75c73",
    "item_id": "c46f83c9-c551-4abb-9447-c7b2f6412e1b",
    "text": "Ja, op vertrouwen. Participatie, samenleving.",
    "start_time": 328.896,
    "end_time": 333.857,
    "audio_url": "https://voxpop.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/audio/formats/dcacd05c-ff24-4403-84b1-c89857052dcb/7b8df080-8949-4caf-962a-6f048ecbf1d1.mp3",
    "tier": "holdout",
    "format_id": "dcacd05c-ff24-4403-84b1-c89857052dcb",
    "duration": 4.961
  },
  {
    "id": "933bd7e9-e13f-4b36-80aa-0a961a40a9a7",
    "item_id": "c46f83c9-c551-4abb-9447-c7b2f6412e1b",
    "text": "Ja, ik heb inderdaad een schokkende ontdekking gedaan en daar kom ik straks. Dit boek heet Cue the Sun. En het gaat over non-scripted.",
    "start_time": 1751.489,
    "end_time": 1758.017,
    "audio_url": "https://voxpop.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/audio/formats/dcacd05c-ff24-4403-84b1-c89857052dcb/7b8df080-8949-4caf-962a-6f048ecbf1d1.mp3",
